title: "The Great British Bake Off Dataset & AI Training Corpus"
abstract: "A comprehensive tidy dataset and AI training corpus for the television series The Great British Bake Off (GBBO), covering 17 series across relational tables, SQLite database, Apache Arrow, native R formats, and instruction-tuning corpora."
